(exclude ($NeedsBar $PerBar) "The concept case, and the combinations no other case subsumes. Every other case with NeedsBar gives its twin's output with NoBarIdentity wherever it is defined, and every other case with OneRun its twin's with CountCells or PerBar. With RightDiagonal, PerBar is defined only where the bars share one line, and there it gives CountCells' output.")
